{"candidate_identity":"17bad941345c157e236c615383904c11f5576f51f9842ef7575774c0a58891b5","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bf7ae3c23ebc9fc22e1730098db2eb8214c12e7aee17e607f221883fa8eb804c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"32ee581f84fe72b93db62fb880de61b9d8c99d370d276ab69904fe82725117b8","logical_entry_identity":"ff1b2236621cb45133f041209ee1e6968f9c0305de2a09b6f3e01e9d71a503ac","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You enter an aggressive battle stance, increasing Accuracy by %d and Physical Power by %d, at the cost of -10 Defense and -10 Armour.\n\t\tWhile berserking, you are nearly unstoppable, granting you %d%% stun and pinning resistance.\n\t\tThe Accuracy bonus increases with your Dexterity, and the Physical Power bonus with your Strength.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"进入狂暴的战斗状态，以减少 10 点闪避和 10 点护甲的代价增加 %d 点命中和 %d 点物理强度。\n\t\t开启狂暴时你无人能挡，增加 %d%% 震慑和定身抵抗。\n\t\t命中受敏捷值加成；\n\t\t物理强度受力量值加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ade5009c668621bdf1788eca1a1f87552bfd476013ed8640e05ce2f8e447a4c9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"32f0f842db5451a759747bcdd6159ab3cef297e3d28b6ae05f5c8efefee71012","logical_entry_identity":"463857bb2ed3a7f846a2d0327dcbe7967956fd4bdfd9444bf9cb9016f4e6272e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fire an arrow tipped with a smoke bomb inflicting %d%% damage and creating a radius %d cloud of thick, disorientating smoke. Those caught within will have their vision range reduced by %d for 5 turns.\nThe distraction caused by this effect reduces the cooldown of your Concealment by %d turns. If the cooldown is reduced to 0, you instantly activate Concealment regardless of whether foes are too close.\nThe chance for the smoke bomb to affect your targets increases with your Accuracy. This requires a bow to use.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"发射一个带着烟雾弹的箭头造成 %d%% 伤害并制造一个半径为 %d 的烟雾。被困在内的人将减少视野 %d 格 5 回合。\n此效果将减少你隐匿技能 %d 回合冷却时间。如果冷却时间减到 0, 无论敌人是否太近，都可立即激活隐匿。\n烟雾弹影响目标的几率受命中值加成。该技能需要弓来使用。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1072b9874d9a112d0d08db63d3af399ae22165b11ca2497fc106183ff9e3b88c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3300874905146af7e18c638fb816b2a5490256ec272ae11f944020ded36d3424","logical_entry_identity":"e40bcf161fdcac73d28304a361dc2ec43f9f9984439a2372a86e9ae859b636eb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You summon your future self to fight alongside you for %d turns.  At some point in the future, you'll be pulled into the past to fight alongside your past self after the initial effect ends.\n\t\tThis spell splits the timeline.  Attempting to use another spell that also splits the timeline while this effect is active will be unsuccessful.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你召唤未来的自己和你一起战斗，持续 %d 回合。当技能结束后，在未来的某个时间点，你会被拉回到过去，协助你自己战斗。\n\t\t这个法术会使时间线分裂，所以其他同样能使时间线分裂的技能在此期间不能成功释放。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"16ad1af6b067dd3fc08f897bd9d9de80d8e71107466fab881ca83d408bd07cb2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3302af6da51a9a21cda51a167d96756b6311e25f907362736ae0ecba4882ee56","logical_entry_identity":"03cffe6c9ad897b35bc9b8de1868d7ce4124d66940eabe18a573ecc28444f26c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Toggles between a bottom or side display for tactial healthbars.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"血条位置切换：侧边或者底部#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6361a2fa37d431700e9e905bb687789290023aa522ba631d29ec37d62c6efcb9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"33093b8aa810a054856a85b577edde2af7126f54b150075cd046f367f8ce505b","logical_entry_identity":"a11e7902283b59de1945d34f18c14ea1488563c4f89224fdf14c05056fb9000a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"yew wand","source_tag":"entity name","target":"紫杉魔杖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eb054f78cb1e79247d2bcbc17efc0e9ec12b4af31e1af3cfb870d5ed07de676f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"330eb6d8e5a2857c74dd6874d6a035eaeb4e258b478e2bb729c550840b18871d","logical_entry_identity":"4e4dd22fba7ca8bdbdd1b8d